cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ELISA Pilot Dilution Planner"
type: software
version: "0.4.1"
date-released: 2026-09-03
authors:
  - family-names: "SY"
    given-names: "Lexian"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lexian-sy/elisa-pilot-dilution-planner"
url: "https://elisa-planner.lexiansy.space/"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based planning aid for choosing pilot ELISA sample dilutions from an
  assay's usable range, a rough analyte concentration estimate, sample and well
  constraints, replicates, and a minimum reliable pipetting volume. It
  visualizes mathematical dilution coverage and flags direct preparations below
  the pipetting minimum; it does not validate assay performance or fit ELISA
  standard curves.
keywords:
  - ELISA
  - dilution planning
  - assay development
  - wet lab
  - laboratory software